                                "sense_id": "23c03e21-0423-334b-996d-744f8c7d557d",
                                "text": "A curious fetishistic fear of this grimy volume on the part of her mother prevented her ever allowing it to stay in the house all night, and hither it was brought back whenever it had been consulted."
